&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;＊１　厚生労働省公表の製造業の全国平均値&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;＊２　ストレスチェック委託業者公表の全国平均値&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;そのほか、当社グループにおける従業員の健康と安全にかかる具体的な取り組みの詳細は、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;「サステナビリティ報告書」&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;をご参照ください。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;2023年度の情報は、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;当社ウェブサイト（https://www.jp.nikon.com/company/sustainability/report/）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;に2024年７月下旬公開予定です。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E02271-000:PolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentStrategyAndDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndResultsUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">女性管理職比率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">2025年度末まで</jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">％</jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">新卒採用における女性比率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
